    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n12269" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">daemŏnĭum</span></b> , ii,
			n., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δαιμόνιον</span>. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A lesser divinity, a little spirit</i>,
					<i><span class="en">Manil. 2, 938</span></i>;
					<i><span class="en">Tert. Apol.
			32</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>An evil spirit, demon</i>,
				<i><span class="en">App. Mag. p. 315, 10</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Vulg.
				Deut. p. 32, 17</span></i>; Psa. 95, 5 et saep.;
				<i><span class="en">Tert. Apol. 21 al.</span></i></div>
